      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤其，是『秋华赏』。\n母亲生涯首次以GⅠ头号人气发起挑战……\n却最终败北的，那场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4217f12ce9de9b246d046e39efe10eec4d0ac1246e01ffabcfd73af68e27af",
