    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56565390533aab310929ec81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与空中救世主面对彼此，把誓言铭记于心。\n传承将在这片土地上完成，\n命运已经开始奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ca6ef3bcf097f502d0c8414d35396cfeaea1389c971976ba8d63311c823fa5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        95,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/95/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5477013ba001a6b5c4b6342c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与她共同挑战的闪耀・系列赛，\n终于要开始了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b9f644e35f2017b10f0b0276880fb8413c44f4043f7d2a2713fcf0ffdbd6113",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
